  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Arbetarskydd p&#xe5; Ignalina</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safety, health cond Ignal</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektm&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att arbetsmilj&#xf6;n p&#xe5; Ignalina K&#xe4;rnkraftverk skall f&#xf6;ljaden i Litauen nyligen introducerade arbetsmilj&#xf6;lagstiftningen. Detta skall uppn&#xe5;s genom utbildning av handledare och instrukt&#xf6;rer vid k&#xe4;rnkraftverket. Underlaget f&#xf6;r utbildningen &#xe4;r Arbetarskyddsn&#xe4;mndens och ILOs material &quot;Safety-Health and Working Conditions&quot;.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main purpose of the project is to improve the working conditions in the Nuclear plant Ignalina. This improvement will be achieved through training of trainers (staff currently working at Ignalina). The training will be based on the material &quot; Safety-Health and WorkingConditions&quot; produced by Arbetarskyddsn&#xe4;mnden and ILO.</narrative>
  </description>
